                </svg>
              </a>
              <a
                href="https://github.com/AhmedSawwah"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="intro-reference__social"
                aria-label="GitHub"
              >
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M12.001 2C6.47598 2 2.00098 6.475 2.00098 12C2.00098 16.425 4.86348 20.1625 8.83848 21.4875C9.33848 21.575 9.52598 21.275 9.52598 21.0125C9.52598 20.775 9.51348 19.9875 9.51348 19.15C7.00098 19.6125 6.35098 18.5375 6.15098 17.975C6.03848 17.6875 5.55098 16.8 5.12598 16.5625C4.77598 16.375 4.27598 15.9125 5.11348 15.9C5.90098 15.8875 6.46348 16.625 6.65098 16.925C7.55098 18.4375 8.98848 18.0125 9.56348 17.75C9.65098 17.1 9.91348 16.6625 10.201 16.4125C7.97598 16.1625 5.65098 15.3 5.65098 11.475C5.65098 10.3875 6.03848 9.4875 6.67598 8.7875C6.57598 8.5375 6.22598 7.5125 6.77598 6.1375C6.77598 6.1375 7.61348 5.875 9.52598 7.1625C10.326 6.9375 11.176 6.825 12.026 6.825C12.876 6.825 13.726 6.9375 14.526 7.1625C16.4385 5.8625 17.276 6.1375 17.276 6.1375C17.826 7.5125 17.476 8.5375 17.376 8.7875C18.0135 9.4875 18.401 10.375 18.401 11.475C18.401 15.3125 16.0635 16.1625 13.8385 16.4125C14.201 16.725 14.5135 17.325 14.5135 18.2625C14.5135 19.6 14.501 20.675 14.501 21.0125C14.501 21.275 14.6885 21.5875 15.1885 21.4875C19.259 20.1133 21.9999 16.2963 22.001 12C22.001 6.475 17.526 2 12.001 2Z"></path>
                </svg>
              </a>
              <a
                href="mailto:aelsawwah@yahoo.com"
                class="intro-reference__social"
                aria-label="Email"
              >
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="m18.73 5.41-1.28 1L12 10.46 6.55 6.37l-1.28-1A2 2 0 0 0 2 7.05v11.59A1.36 1.36 0 0 0 3.36 20h3.19v-7.72L12 16.37l5.45-4.09V20h3.19A1.36 1.36 0 0 0 22 18.64V7.05a2 2 0 0 0-3.27-1.64"></path>
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="intro-reference__location">
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.8"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M20 10c0 5-8 12-8 12S4 15 4 10a8 8 0 1 1 16 0Z"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
              </svg>
              <span>Based in Toronto, Canada and Cairo, Egypt</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="intro-reference__right">
            <div class="intro-reference__photo-wrap">
              <img
                src={`${baseUrl}images/ahmed-profile.jpg`}
                alt="Portrait of Ahmed El-Sawwah"
                class="intro-reference__photo"
                width="720"
                height="720"
                fetchpriority="high"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section id="about" class="about-reference" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
        <h2 id="about-heading" class="about-reference__title section-title-gradient">About Me</h2>

        <div class="about-reference__grid">
          <article class="about-reference__card">
          <p class="about-reference__intro">Hi, I’m Ahmed!</p>

          <p class="about-reference__body">
            I study Computer Science at Queen’s University, specializing in Artificial Intelligence, with interests in machine learning, networking, and building full-stack systems. My interest in computer science began when a friend told me I could be hacked on unsecured public Wi-Fi. My first thought was, “How?” That question introduced me to basic networking concepts and sent me down a rabbit hole I’m still exploring today.
          </p>

          <p class="about-reference__body about-reference__body--last">
            Outside of coding, I enjoy thought provoking games like chess, and learning about paradoxes. I’m drawn to anything involving strategy and psychology. Fun fact: I’ve memorized the flags of all 193 UN member countries, plus a few territories!
            <a class="about-reference__thoughts" href={`${baseUrl}thoughts/`}>
              <span>Inside My Mind</span>
              <svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="14"
                height="14"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
                <path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </p>

          <p class="about-reference__label about-reference__label--education">Education</p>
          <div class="about-reference__education">
            <div class="about-reference__education-card">
              <div class="about-reference__education-logo">
                <img
                  src={`${baseUrl}images/queens.png`}
                  alt=""
                  width="46"
                  height="46"
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="about-reference__education-info">
                <strong>Queen’s University</strong>
                <span>
                  Bachelor of Computing (Honours) · Artificial Intelligence Specialization · 2024–2028
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="about-reference__education-card">
              <div class="about-reference__education-logo">
                <img
                  src={`${baseUrl}images/queens.png`}
                  alt=""
                  width="46"
                  height="46"
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="about-reference__education-info">
                <strong>Queen’s University</strong>
                <span>Minor in Linguistics · 2024–2028</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          </article>

          <aside class="about-reference__photos" aria-labelledby="about-gallery-heading">
            <p id="about-gallery-heading" class="about-reference__gallery-label">
              A little earlier:
            </p>

            <div
              class="about-reference__gallery"
              role="region"
              aria-label="Photos of Ahmed"
              data-about-gallery
            >
              <div class="about-reference__gallery-view" aria-live="polite">
                <figure
                  class="about-reference__gallery-item is-active"
                  data-gallery-item
                  aria-hidden="false"
                >
                  <img
                    src={`${baseUrl}images/ahmed-early-1.webp`}
                    alt="Ahmed as a child standing by a doorway"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  />
                </figure>

                <figure
                  class="about-reference__gallery-item"
                  data-gallery-item
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <img
                    src={`${baseUrl}images/ahmed-early-2.webp`}
                    alt="Ahmed as a child at a birthday celebration"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  />
                </figure>

                <figure
                  class="about-reference__gallery-item"
                  data-gallery-item
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <img
                    src={`${baseUrl}images/ahmed-early-3.webp`}
                    alt="Ahmed as a child sitting at a restaurant"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  />
                </figure>

                <figure
                  class="about-reference__gallery-item"
                  data-gallery-item
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <img
                    src={`${baseUrl}images/ahmed-early-4.webp`}
                    alt="Ahmed smiling as a child"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  />
                </figure>

                <figure
                  class="about-reference__gallery-item"
                  data-gallery-item
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <img
                    src={`${baseUrl}images/ahmed-early-5.webp`}
                    alt="Ahmed as a child sitting in a car seat"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  />
                </figure>

                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="about-reference__gallery-arrow about-reference__gallery-arrow--prev"
                  aria-label="Previous photo"
                  data-gallery-prev
                >
                  <span aria-hidden="true">‹</span>
                </button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="about-reference__gallery-arrow about-reference__gallery-arrow--next"
                  aria-label="Next photo"
                  data-gallery-next
                >
                  <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
                </button>
              </div>

              <div class="about-reference__gallery-dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose photo">
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="about-reference__gallery-dot is-active"
                  aria-label="Show photo 1"
                  aria-selected="true"
                  role="tab"
                  data-gallery-dot
                ></button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="about-reference__gallery-dot"
                  aria-label="Show photo 2"
                  aria-selected="false"
                  role="tab"
                  data-gallery-dot
                ></button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="about-reference__gallery-dot"
                  aria-label="Show photo 3"
                  aria-selected="false"
                  role="tab"
                  data-gallery-dot
                ></button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="about-reference__gallery-dot"
                  aria-label="Show photo 4"
                  aria-selected="false"
                  role="tab"
                  data-gallery-dot
                ></button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="about-reference__gallery-dot"
                  aria-label="Show photo 5"
                  aria-selected="false"
                  role="tab"
                  data-gallery-dot
                ></button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <LogoWall />

    <div
      id="experience"
      class="relative left-1/2 w-[min(1150px,calc(100vw-2rem))] -translate-x-1/2 py-12 md:py-[72px]"
    >
      <SkillsList />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<script>
  const aboutGallery = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-about-gallery]");

  if (aboutGallery) {
    const items = Array.from(
      aboutGallery.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-gallery-item]"),
    );
    const dots = Array.from(
      aboutGallery.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-gallery-dot]"),
    );
    const previous = aboutGallery.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-gallery-prev]");
    const next = aboutGallery.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-gallery-next]");
    let activeIndex = 0;

    const showPhoto = (index: number) => {
      activeIndex = (index + items.length) % items.length;

      items.forEach((item, itemIndex) => {
        const isActive = itemIndex === activeIndex;
        item.classList.toggle("is-active", isActive);
        item.setAttribute("aria-hidden", String(!isActive));
      });

      dots.forEach((dot, dotIndex) => {
        const isActive = dotIndex === activeIndex;
        dot.classList.toggle("is-active", isActive);
        dot.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(isActive));
      });
    };

    previous?.addEventListener("click", () => showPhoto(activeIndex - 1));
    next?.addEventListener("click", () => showPhoto(activeIndex + 1));
    dots.forEach((dot, index) => dot.addEventListener("click", () => showPhoto(index)));
  }
</script>

<style is:global>
  @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap");

  .shiny-sec {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a476ff 25%, #eee5ff 50%, #a476ff 75%);
    background-size: 400% 100%;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    animation: shine 3s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes shine {
    0% {
      background-position: 100% 50%;
    }
    30%,
    70% {
      background-position: 0% 50%;
    }
  }
  .intro-reference,
  .intro-reference * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  }

  .intro-reference {
    position: relative;
    left: 50%;
    display: grid;
    width: min(1150px, calc(100vw - 2rem));
    min-height: clamp(460px, 64vh, 620px);
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 0 0;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .intro-reference__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .intro-reference__kicker {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: #c7bfb3;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .intro-reference__title {
    margin: 0;
    color: #f4efe7;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4.1rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .intro-reference__subtitle {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: #c7bfb3;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .intro-reference__description {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    color: #c7bfb3;
    font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .intro-reference__buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 26px;
  }

  .intro-reference__button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #58b36866;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #73c982;
    background: #58b36814;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.45;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      color 250ms ease,
      background 250ms ease,
      transform 250ms ease;
  }

  .intro-reference__button svg {
    display: block;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    flex: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .intro-reference__button:hover,
  .intro-reference__button:focus-visible {
    border-color: #58b368b3;
    color: #9ae5a7;
    background: #58b36824;
    outline: none;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .intro-reference__signature {
    position: relative;
    width: max-content;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding-right: 56px;
    border-right: 2px solid #73c982;
    color: #73c982;
    font-family: "Segoe Script", "Brush Script MT", cursive;
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    animation: intro-signature-blink 700ms step-end infinite;
  }

  .intro-reference__socials {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .intro-reference__social {
    display: grid;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid #3a352d;
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: #f4efe7;
    background: #1d1d1d;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      color 250ms ease,
      border-color 250ms ease,
      transform 250ms ease;
  }

  .intro-reference__social svg {
    display: block;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  .intro-reference__social:hover,
  .intro-reference__social:focus-visible {
    color: #f4efe7;
    border-color: #f3e7d1;
    outline: 2px solid #f3e7d1;
    outline-offset: 2px;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .intro-reference__location {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: #a9a39a;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .intro-reference__location svg {
    display: block;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    flex: 0 0 16px;
    color: #c7bfb3;
  }

  .intro-reference__right {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .intro-reference__photo-wrap {
    width: min(430px, 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border: 1px solid #3a352d;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: #1d1d1d;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .intro-reference__photo {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  @keyframes intro-signature-blink {
    50% {
      border-color: transparent;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .intro-reference__layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .intro-reference__right {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .intro-reference__photo-wrap {
      width: min(340px, 100%);
    }

  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .intro-reference__buttons {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .intro-reference__signature {
      padding-right: 46px;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .intro-reference__button,
    .intro-reference__social {
      transition: none;
    }

    .intro-reference__signature {
      width: auto;
      border-right: 0;
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  .about-reference,
  .about-reference * {
    font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  }

  .about-reference {
    position: relative;
    left: 50%;
    width: min(1150px, calc(100vw - 2rem));
    padding: 36px 0 72px;
    border-top: 1px solid #ffffff10;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff10;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .about-reference__title {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    color: #f4efe7;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .about-reference__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 22px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-reference__card,
  .about-reference__photos {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid #3a352d;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #1d1d1d;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    transition:
      transform 300ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
      border-color 300ms ease,
      box-shadow 300ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .about-reference__photos {
    align-self: center;
  }

  .about-reference__card:hover,
  .about-reference__photos:hover {
    border-color: #756f66;
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow:
      0 24px 64px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35),
      0 0 0 1px #59544c;
  }

  .about-reference__intro {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: #f4efe7;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .about-reference__body {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: #c7bfb3;
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .about-reference__body--last {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-reference__thoughts {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    margin-left: 8px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border: 1px solid #58b36866;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #73c982;
    background: #58b36814;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.4;
